WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
Beyond our world,

2
00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:04.910
humanity dared to explore the unknown.

3
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.400
From historic missions,

4
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.070
extraordinary machines carried our dreams

5
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.820
across the universe.

6
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.810
Some still journey.

7
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.320
Others fell silent.

8
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.440
But none are forgotten.
